cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "OncoTox: single-cell drug-response prediction with foundation-model embeddings"
abstract: >-
  Predicts anti-cancer drug response from single-cell transcriptomes, comparing scGPT
  foundation-model embeddings against a matched PCA baseline. Trains a shared-trunk
  multi-task regressor on the intersection of the SCP542 single-cell atlas and the
  CTRPv2 drug-response screen, evaluated under a leave-cell-line-out protocol.
type: software
authors:
